      <h2 id="ai-overview-title">
        Not every business problem needs artificial intelligence.
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="ai-overview__copy">
      <p>
        Traditional software is still better for many predictable
        tasks because deterministic rules are easier to test,
        understand and control.
      </p>

      <p>
        AI becomes useful when the workflow includes language,
        interpretation, unstructured information, classification,
        summarisation or other work where rigid rules become
        impractical.
      </p>

      <p>
        Our approach is to identify that boundary first, then use AI
        only where it produces a meaningful operational advantage.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
